  "solution": "**Formula used:**\n\n(a² - b²) = (a + b)(a - b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(2.25²-1.25²)/(2.25-1.25)\n\nBy using the above identity\n\n⇒ ((2.25-1.25)(2.25 + 1.25))/((2.25-1.25))\n\n⇒ 2.25 + 1.25\n\n⇒ 3.5\n\n**∴ (2.25²-1.25²)/(2.25-1.25) = 3.5 **",
